        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WBC6353, Solid Brass 6\" Pentagon Wire Corner Basket</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeltana's WBC6353 Basket features an easy installation. It is perfect to utilize corner space not only in the bathroom as a shampoo shelf, but also in the kitchen, the bedroom, the garage, or just about any room where you need some extra storage space. It is made out of solid brass with the attention to high quality that is expected from Deltana. Available in polished chrome, satin nickel, and pvd polished brass finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBC6353-specifications.gif?v=1704354737\" width=\"295\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana WBC6353 6\" Pentagon Corner Wire Basket Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/collections/bathroom-hardware-1\"><b>Deltana Wire Baskets</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the WBC6353 Solid Brass Corner Basket:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 6-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 6-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBC6353.pdf?v=1704262292\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WBC6353 6\" Pentagon Corner Wire Basket Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 basket, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
